  "question": {
    "text": "Two particles <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> of same mass have their de-Broglie wavelengths in the ratio <math><msub><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Their potential energies <math><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> The ratio of their total energies <math><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn><mi> </mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>K</mi><mi> </mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
